# Regression: "fib n minus 1" is (fib n) minus 1, so this recursion never
# ends. otterPS stops at its call depth limit; otter-net crashed with a raw
# .NET stack overflow before reaching the same limit (found 2026-10-16).
to fib n
    if n is less than 2
        return n
    .
    left is fib n minus 1
    right is fib n minus 2
    return left plus right
.
say fib 20
